28. Behavioral pass logic

Each test has critical and non-critical assertions.

if (criticalAssertionFails) {
  status = "FAIL";
} else if (allAssertionsPass) {
  status = "PASS";
} else {
  status = "PARTIAL";
}

Do not allow a high prose score to compensate for a critical reasoning error.

Example:

If Hilbert says AOV means price on a case where that is unsupported:

FAIL.

