58. Mining real contrastive pairs

Write a script that searches real cohort / time-window candidates.

Example logic:

pairs = []

for a in candidates:
    for b in candidates:
        if a.id == b.id:
            continue

        if abs(a.revenue_per_customer_pct - b.revenue_per_customer_pct) <= 2:
            if (
                a.visit_frequency_pct >= 5
                and b.visit_frequency_pct <= -5
                and a.aov_pct <= b.aov_pct
            ):
                pairs.append((a, b))

Then manually inspect / approve.

Do not automatically call mined pairs gold.

